---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
import SocialItems from '@/components/SocialItems.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <Header selectedSection="about" />
  <div class="wrapper">
    <section class="about-me">
      <div class="about-me-text">
        <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
        <p>
          Kristaps has extensive knowledge in Web3, iOS, and other Apple technologies, frontend,
          and databases.
        </p>
        <p>
          Executed as technical co-founder at global scale company
          <a href="https://www.qminder.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Qminder</a>
          that serviced companies like Bolt, Uber, Lyft, The Olympic Games.
        </p>
        <p>
          He is an active Web3 and iOS community member. He writes blog posts about Web3 and mobile
          development and regularly speaks at conferences and meetups. In addition, he teaches and
          mentors.
        </p>
        <p>
          He writes a mobile development blog, regularly speaks at conferences, teaches, and
          mentors.
        </p>
        <p>His interests are in Web 3.0, sustainability, and automating old and clunky processes.</p>
        <p>
          Kristaps is an active volunteer in organizations like
          <a href="http://www.rigatechgirls.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Riga Tech Girls</a
          >,
          <a href="https://www.dzivniekubriviba.lv/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Animal Freedom</a
          >, and many more.
        </p>
        <p>His hobbies are orienteering sport, cycling, and cooking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-me-social-items">
        <SocialItems />
      </div>
      <div class="about-me-images">
        <img src="/assets/speaking/kristaps-grinbergs-appbuilders.jpeg" alt="" />
        <img src="/assets/speaking/kristaps-grinbergs-nft-tallinn.jpeg" alt="" />
        <img src="/assets/speaking/kristaps-grinbergs-nft-tallinn-panel.jpg" alt="" />
        <img src="/assets/speaking/kristaps-grinbergs-mobile-era.jpg" alt="" />
        <img src="/assets/speaking/kristaps-grinbergs-shareit.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
